      "payload": {
        "chunks": [
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "Our Productivity and Business Processes segment consists of products and services in our portfolio of productivity, communication, and information services, spanning a variety of devices and platforms.",
            "entity_name": "MSFT Productivity and Business Processes Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "Our Intelligent Cloud segment consists of our public, private, and hybrid server products and cloud services that power modern business and developers.",
            "entity_name": "MSFT Intelligent Cloud Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "Our More Personal Computing segment consists of products and services that put customers at the center of the experience with our technology.",
            "entity_name": "MSFT More Personal Computing Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "In 2020, we announced goals to become a carbon negative, water positive, and zero waste company by 2030.",
            "entity_name": "MSFT 2030 Carbon Negative Commitment",
            "entity_type_entity": "ESGCommitment",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "esg_commitment",
            "content": "In 2020, we announced goals to become a carbon negative, water positive, and zero waste company by 2030.",
            "entity_name": "MSFT 2030 Water Positive Commitment",
            "entity_type_entity": "ESGCommitment",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In August 2024, we announced changes to the composition of our segments. These changes align our segments with how we currently manage our business, most notably bringing the commercial components of Microsoft 365 together in the Productivity and Business Processes segment. Beginning in fiscal year 2025, the information that our chief operating decision maker is regularly provided and reviews for purposes of allocating resources and assessing performance reflects these segment changes.",
            "entity_name": "MSFT August 2024 Segment Reorganization",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "executive_biography",
            "content": "Mr. Nadella was appointed Chairman of the Board in June 2021 and Chief Executive Officer in February 2014. He served as Executive Vice President, Cloud and Enterprise from July 2013 until that time. From 2011 to 2013, Mr. Nadella served as President, Server and Tools.",
            "entity_name": "Satya Nadella",
            "entity_type_entity": "Person",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "executive_biography",
            "content": "Mr. Althoff was appointed Executive Vice President and Chief Commercial Officer in July 2021. He served as Executive Vice President, Worldwide Commercial Business from July 2017 until that time. Prior to that, Mr. Althoff served as the President of Microsoft North America.",
            "entity_name": "Judson B. Althoff",
            "entity_type_entity": "Person",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "executive_biography",
            "content": "Ms. Coleman was appointed Executive Vice President and Chief Human Resources Officer in March 2025. She previously served as Corporate Vice President, Human Resources and Corporation Functions since January 2021. Prior to that, Ms. Coleman served as Vice President Human Resources and Corporate Functions since September 2020.",
            "entity_name": "Amy L. Coleman",
            "entity_type_entity": "Person",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "executive_biography",
            "content": "Ms. Hogan was appointed Executive Vice President, Office of Strategy and Transformation in March 2025. She previously served as Executive Vice President and Chief Human Resources Officer since June 2023. Ms. Hogan had been Executive Vice President, Human Resources since November 2014.",
            "entity_name": "Kathleen T. Hogan",
            "entity_type_entity": "Person",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "executive_biography",
            "content": "Ms. Hood was appointed Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer in July 2013, subsequent to her appointment as Chief Financial Officer in May 2013. From 2010 to 2013, Ms. Hood was Chief Financial Officer of the Microsoft Business Division.",
            "entity_name": "Amy E. Hood",
            "entity_type_entity": "Person",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "executive_biography",
            "content": "Mr. Numoto was appointed Executive Vice President and Chief Marketing Officer in October 2023. He served as Executive Vice President and Commercial Chief Marketing Officer from March 2020.",
            "entity_name": "Takeshi Numoto",
            "entity_type_entity": "Person",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "executive_biography",
            "content": "Mr. Smith was appointed Vice Chair and President in September 2021. Prior to that, he served as President and Chief Legal Officer since September 2015. He served as Executive Vice President, General Counsel, and Secretary from 2011 to 2015, and served as Senior Vice President, General Counsel, and Secretary from 2001 to 2011.",
            "entity_name": "Bradford L. Smith",
            "entity_type_entity": "Person",
            "valid_from": "2025-07-30",
            "valid_until": null
          }
        ],
